&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role..&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Creative Director to lead the Soho Home Creative team and shape the visual expression of the brand across photography, campaigns, content, art direction, digital, editorial and wider brand communications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with the Chief Creative Officer, this role will translate the creative vision for Soho Home into a distinctive and cohesive visual world, ensuring every touchpoint feels considered, relevant and unmistakably Soho Home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Creative Director will lead the creative team and oversee the full creative process from concept and creative direction through to execution, ensuring a consistently high standard across all imagery and brand communications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly collaborative role, working closely with the Head of Creative, Marketing, Photography, Content and wider Soho House teams to create compelling visual messaging that builds the Soho Home brand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities..&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Creative Direction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Chief Creative Officer to define and evolve the overall creative direction and visual identity of Soho Home.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate the wider brand vision into a clear and distinctive visual language across all creative output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the creative standard for Motion, photography, art direction, campaigns, editorial, digital and content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all creative output feels cohesive whilst allowing for freshness, experimentation and evolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop creative concepts and visual narratives that bring Soho Home products, collections and collaborations to life.&lt;/li&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a&amp;nbsp;Design Director&amp;nbsp;to lead the Soho Home Design team and drive the creative direction, quality, and delivery of our product collections across Furniture, Upholstery, Lighting, Mirrors, Décor and Textiles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with the Chief Creative Officer, this role will translate the overarching creative vision for Soho Home into a clear, ownable and commercially relevant product direction - ensuring every collection feels distinctive &amp;amp; cohesive to Soho Home.&lt;/p&gt;
