&lt;li&gt;Translate the wider Soho Home creative vision into clear product and category direction for the Design team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a strong and consistent creative point of view across all categories and seasons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure collections feel considered as a whole, with a clear balance of statement pieces, core products and commercial opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push the team to develop products with a strong design narrative, whilst maintaining the quality, craftsmanship and functionality expected of Soho Home.&lt;/li&gt;
